      "text": "亲手锻造抛光装备再上架售卖",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Here, you'll need to roll up your sleeves—and wave your paws—to personally hammer cold metal into top-tier weapons, sturdy armor, and impenetrable shields. Polish them until they sparkle before displaying them on your shelves.",
